>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">N/A</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Time\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Time</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0.4</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Swing Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Swing Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">24 studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"AOE Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">AOE Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2.5 studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Pickaxe Power\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickaxe Power</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2 (can mine <a href=\"/wiki/Refined_pickaxe\" title=\"Refined pickaxe\">refined pickaxe</a> requiring stones)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$44,000 (<a href=\"/wiki/Reinforced_Pickaxe\" title=\"Reinforced Pickaxe\">Reinforced Pickaxe</a>)</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.95.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Lightningbane is an extremely speedy pickaxe with a decent area-of-effect. A full charge only takes about a quarter second, making this the fastest swinging pickaxe in the game. It is comparable to the <a href=\"/wiki/Petalfall\" title=\"Petalfall\">Petalfall Katana</a> in pickaxe form.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The Lightning Bane Pickaxe looks like a staff with the <b>Lightning Core</b> affixed to the top, and the head being transparent and blue. Two glowing lightning bolt symbols protrude from the bottom of the handle. An electricity particle flows down both sides of the head and the handle from the core in the middle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</span></h2>\n<ol><li>Obtain the following materials:\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/Zapium\" title=\"Zapium\">Zapium</a> (Must be Forged)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Reinforced_Pickaxe\" title=\"Reinforced Pickaxe\">Reinforced Pickaxe</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Core\" title=\"Lightning Core\">Lightning Core</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Michael%27s_Copper_Axe\" title=\"Michael&#39;s Copper Axe\">Copper Axe</a> (You will likely need more than one due to it having a 50% chance to lose it's lightning-summoning ability)</li></ol></li>\n<li>Head to the area a ways behind <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a> until you find the <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Shrine\" title=\"Lightning Shrine\">copper shrine</a> with 4 lightning rods surrounding it.</li>\n<li>Wait for a thunderstorm to begin.</li>\n<li>Hold the <b>Copper Axe</b> inside of the outermost lightning rod until it is struck and activates.\n<ol><li>Do this for all 4 Lightning Rods.</li></ol></li>\n<li>Carry the <b>Zapium</b>, <b>Reinforced Pickaxe</b>, and <b>Lightning Core</b> down the now-opened hole into the shrine, and place them into the blue bowl inside of the Cave.</li></ol>\n<p>For a simple and quick tutorial showing these steps, see <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://youtu.be/gqwZEawUp54\">this video</a>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902183018\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 81/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019440/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   40.216      1 Template:Pickaxe\n100.00%   40.216      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4661-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902183018 and revision id 21536. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Pickaxes"],"links":[{"title":"Refined pickaxe","exists":true},{"title":"Reinforced Pickaxe","exists":true},{"title":"Alan's AutoL